  "description": "Demolition of detached garage and single storey rear extension. Erection of single storey front, rear/side extension and part first floor rear/side extension. Erection of roof extension with installation of 7nos. rooflights to facilitate loft conversion.",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first floor side extension due to its siting would result in the loss of the original cat-slide roof which is a distinct feature of properties on Portland Avenue and the wider area and worthy of retention.  As such, the proposed development is considered to be harmful to the character and appearance of the existing dwelling and the street scene, contrary to Policies  D3 of the London Plan 2021, DM10 of the Council's adopted LDF Core Strategy April 2012 and Policy Guidance 37 of the Council's Residential Design SPD, 2013.\r"
